- op: discuss  # 6412
  at: '2026-10-05T11:48:24Z'  # 6412
  by: agent  # 6412
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6412
  clock: 4  # 6412
  nonce: '6412'  # 6412
  message: "Partial fix merged in PR #1469 (stage 9a). A function whose return statement carries a source's value now makes each caller's invocation of it a source site, decided by the existing reachability, DDG walk and collapse; a multi-value return seeds only the result position carrying the value. Behavioural evidence (komoj.md fixtures): the filed Python and Go helper shapes move from confirmed_with_caveats/inconclusive to violated, matching their inline twins; controls (constant return, return inside a nested function, os.path.exists(os.getenv(..)), caller returning only err) stay clean. Integration fix: the lift's walk is spelled 'is True' so the INV-lupav guard sees it collapsed. Status set to pending_validation, NOT satisfied: the general statement still fails for Rust tail expressions and JS/TS arrow expression bodies (WI-sodoj, P2) and Go '_, err := get()' (WI-sitaf, P3). Corpus A/B (branch run): podman-compose and runc verdicts inconclusive -> violated (runc is a false positive via call-reachability rows): tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation."  # 6412
